      <profiles>
        <profile name="Eaten from the Inside" typeId="fe4c-5b77-ab77-e578" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="ccf6-6fd7-fdb1-1a34">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5cee-5283-c95d-c323">If an enemy model is successfully destroyed by an attack made by this unit, after resolving that attack, roll one D6. If the result of that roll is a 3+, add one Flood Infection Form model to this unit. This ability may be used to exceed this unit&apos;s max starting strength.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Inexorable Tide" typeId="fe4c-5b77-ab77-e578" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="9533-06cb-9d55-406a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5cee-5283-c95d-c323">When a Pod Infector model is targeted by an attack made with Melee Weapons, reduce the damage characteristic of that attack to 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Shaping Sickness" id="c9cd-33bc-ebd7-eda2" hidden="false">
          <description>If this unit contains at least one Pod Infector Model, when an enemy model is successfully destroyed by an attack made by a Pod Infector model, roll one D6 after resolving that attack. Refer to the table below for the result of that roll. 


If the target model had the **Swarm** keyword, on a **3+**, add one **Flood Infection Form** model to this unit. 


If the target model had the **Infantry** keywords, on a **4+**, add one **Swollen Host model** to this unit.



If the target model had the **Infantry** and **Human** keywords, on a **4+**, add one **Twisted Human** model instead.


If the target model had the **Infantry** and **Human** keywords, and had a **Toughness** Characteristic **greater than 5**, on a **4+**, add one **Armoured Casket** model to this unit.


If the target model had the **Infantry** and **Xenos** keywords, and had a **Toughness** Characteristic **greater than 5**, on a **4+**, add one **Bipedal Monstrosity** model to this unit.


If the target model does not have any of the following criteria, do not do anything.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Scouts" id="787f-65b9-9e21-a50a" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="ada6-bac1-ffe0-d6f7">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="append" value="6&quot;" field="name"/>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
