  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Shaping Sickness" id="79e4-997a-3ff1-51f8" hidden="false">
      <description>When an enemy model is successfully destroyed by an attack made by a model with this ability, roll one D6 after resolving that attack. Refer to the table below for the result of that roll. 


If the target model had the **Swarm** keyword, on a **3+**, add one **Flood Infection Form** model to this unit. 


If the target model had the **Infantry** keywords, on a **3+**, add one **Swollen Host** model to this unit.


If the target model had the **Infantry** keywords, on a **4+**, add one **Twisted Humanoid** model instead.


If the target model had the **Infantry** keywords, and had a **Toughness** Characteristic **greater than 4**, on a **4+**, add one **Armoured Casket** model to this unit.


If the target model had the **Infantry** keywords, and had a **Toughness** Characteristic **greater than 5**, on a **4+**, add one **Bipedal Monstrosity** model to this unit.


If the target model does not have any of the following criteria, do not do anything.




If this unit contains at least one Pod Infector model, add 1 to the result of that dice roll.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
